WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.719 --> 00:00:10.480 align:start position:19%
Number four, Kopi Luwok. The most
expensive coffee on Earth, made from

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:16.640 align:start position:19%
poop.
In Indonesia, a cat-like animal called

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:22.480 align:start position:19%
the civot eats ripe coffee cherries and
poops out the beans. Farmers collect the

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:27.680 align:start position:19%
beans from the droppings, wash them,
roast them, and sell them for hundreds

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:34.000 align:start position:19%
of dollars per kilo.
One cup in a fancy cafe can cost more

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:40.640 align:start position:19%
than your whole lunch for a week. For
poop coffee, fans say digestion makes it

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:47.200 align:start position:19%
smoother and less bitter. Critics say
you're just drinking

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:52.160 align:start position:19%
expensive poop. The ugly truth, most
copiwok today comes from caged sibs in

00:00:50.239 --> 00:00:56.000 align:start position:19%
rough conditions.
So it's weird and sad.

